# See REVISION.md (changes and reasons) and CIRCUITS.md (the revised network). Blank lines and # comments are ignored.

# ================ A. token embedding ================
# A1. d30 = the hunk id 'h0' (word id 5861): an empty removed-lines side of a hunk line
